(function(E){ const x = E["ai-m3"] = E["ai-m3"] || {units:{}}; x.units["ai-cp-3"] = {"exit":{"id":"c-ai-cp-3-x","course":"ai-internet","unit":"ai-cp-3","type":"exit","items":[{"from":"ai-10","kind":"mcq","prompt":"The draft gives a discount, and the source says nothing about one. What is your result?","options":["Remove or ask","Keep it as it is","Correct the number"],"correct":0,"why":{"en":"Remove or ask: it is a promise you can't find in the source, so it goes unless someone confirms it. 'Correct the number' fits a wrong figure, but here the source has no figure to copy.","tr":"Remove or ask: kaynakta bulamadığın bir sözdür; biri onaylamadıkça çıkar. 'Correct the number' yanlış bir rakam için uygundur, ama burada kaynakta kopyalanacak bir rakam yok.","fa":"Remove or ask درست است، چون این قولی است که در منبع پیدایش نمی‌کنی؛ پس تا کسی تأییدش نکند، حذفش می‌کنی. Correct the number برای عدد غلط است، ولی اینجا عددی در منبع نیست که از رویش درستش کنی."},"point":1},{"from":"ai-10","kind":"blank","prompt":"The price includes a ___ guarantee.","options":["3 years of","3-year","3-years"],"correct":1,"why":{"en":"3-year: before a noun, number + noun works like an adjective, with a hyphen and no -s. '3-years' adds the -s, and '3 years of' needs a different sentence.","tr":"3-year: isimden önce sayı + isim sıfat gibi çalışır; kısa çizgi alır, -s almaz. '3-years' -s ekler; '3 years of' ise farklı bir cümle ister.","fa":"3-year درست است، چون عدد و اسمی که قبل از اسم می‌آید مثل صفت کار می‌کند: خط تیره دارد و s نمی‌گیرد. 3-years یک s اضافه دارد و 3 years of جمله‌ی دیگری لازم دارد."},"point":3},{"from":"ai-11","kind":"mcq","prompt":"Which is plain English?","options":["Lateness is regretted.","I'm sorry to tell you it's late.","We regret to inform you of lateness."],"correct":1,"why":{"en":"I'm sorry to tell you it's late: say it as you would to a person, with a person in the sentence. 'We regret to inform you of lateness' is the stiff style that plain English replaces.","tr":"I'm sorry to tell you it's late: bir insana söyler gibi, cümlede bir kişiyle söyle. 'We regret to inform you of lateness' sade İngilizcenin yerine koyduğu katı resmî üsluptur.","fa":"I'm sorry to tell you it's late درست است، چون همان‌طور است که به یک آدم می‌گویی و یک شخص در جمله هست. We regret to inform you of lateness همان سبک خشک و رسمی است که انگلیسی ساده جایش را می‌گیرد."},"point":3},{"from":"ai-11","kind":"blank","prompt":"I used AI ___ draft this, then I checked it.","options":["by","to","for"],"correct":1,"why":{"en":"to: 'used AI to + verb' says what the tool was for. 'For draft' would need -ing (for drafting), and 'by' doesn't fit here.","tr":"to: 'used AI to + fiil' aracın ne için kullanıldığını söyler. 'For draft' -ing ister (for drafting); 'by' ise burada uymaz.","fa":"to درست است، چون used AI to با فعل ساده می‌گوید ابزار برای چه کاری بود. for draft باید ing بگیرد (for drafting) و by اینجا جور نیست."},"point":2},{"from":"ai-12","kind":"mcq","prompt":"What are the three checks for a claim?","options":["Ask the tool, ask it again, compare the two answers","Open the link, find the title, see what the page says","Read the answer twice, ask a colleague, check the date"],"correct":1,"why":{"en":"Open the link, find the title, see what the page says: a link alone does not prove an answer. Asking the tool twice only shows whether it repeats itself, not whether it is right.","tr":"Open the link, find the title, see what the page says: tek başına bir bağlantı cevabı kanıtlamaz. Araca iki kez sormak yalnızca kendini tekrar edip etmediğini gösterir, doğru olup olmadığını değil.","fa":"Open the link, find the title, see what the page says درست است، چون لینک به‌تنهایی جواب را ثابت نمی‌کند. دو بار پرسیدن از ابزار فقط نشان می‌دهد حرفش را تکرار می‌کند یا نه، نه اینکه درست است یا نه."},"point":5},{"from":"ai-12","kind":"mcq","prompt":"Which sentence shows your limit?","options":["Everyone agrees that it's correct.","As far as I can tell, it's correct.","It's definitely correct, as I said."],"correct":1,"why":{"en":"As far as I can tell, it's correct: it says how sure you are and leaves room for doubt. 'Everyone agrees that it's correct' claims more than you checked.","tr":"As far as I can tell, it's correct: ne kadar emin olduğunu söyler ve şüpheye yer bırakır. 'Everyone agrees that it's correct' kontrol ettiğinden fazlasını iddia eder.","fa":"As far as I can tell, it's correct درست است، چون می‌گوید چقدر مطمئنی و جا برای تردید می‌گذارد. Everyone agrees that it's correct بیشتر از چیزی که بررسی کرده‌ای ادعا می‌کند."},"point":6},{"from":"ai-9","kind":"mcq","prompt":"What must a tool never do without you?","options":["Make a short list","Send, buy or delete","Read a long file"],"correct":1,"why":{"en":"Send, buy or delete: these can't be undone, so keep a stop point before them. Making a list or reading a file changes nothing outside the tool.","tr":"Send, buy or delete: bunlar geri alınamaz, bu yüzden öncesine bir durma noktası koy. Liste yapmak ya da dosya okumak aracın dışında hiçbir şeyi değiştirmez.","fa":"Send, buy or delete درست است، چون این کارها برگشت ندارند؛ پس قبل از آن‌ها نقطه‌ی توقف بگذار. فهرست ساختن یا خواندن فایل بیرون از ابزار چیزی را عوض نمی‌کند."},"point":1},{"from":"ai-6","kind":"mcq","prompt":"The answer is close, but too formal. What do you do?","options":["Start a new chat.","Close the tool.","Write a follow-up."],"correct":2,"why":{"en":"Write a follow-up: the answer is close, so say what to keep and what to change. Starting a new chat throws away a nearly right answer.","tr":"Write a follow-up: cevap hedefe yakın; neyin kalacağını ve neyin değişeceğini söyle. Yeni sohbet başlatmak neredeyse doğru bir cevabı çöpe atar.","fa":"Write a follow-up درست است، چون جواب نزدیک است؛ پس بگو چه بماند و چه عوض شود. شروع گفت‌وگوی تازه جوابی را که تقریباً درست است دور می‌ریزد."},"point":4}]},"writing":{"id":"c-ai-cp-3-w","title":{"en":"Clean the draft","tr":"Taslağı temizle","fa":"پیش‌نویس را تمیز کن"},"course":"ai-internet","unit":"ai-cp-3","type":"writing","difficulty":"medium","modelBy":"FEschool","portfolio":"ai-final-2","prompt":{"en":"Read the customer's message, the order line and the AI draft. Correct the facts, the tone and the gaps. Answer her two questions. Then write a change note.","tr":"Müşterinin mesajını, sipariş satırını ve yapay zekâ taslağını oku. Bilgileri, üslubu ve eksikleri düzelt. İki sorusunu yanıtla. Sonra değişiklik notu yaz.","fa":"پیام مشتری، خط سفارش و پیش‌نویس هوش مصنوعی را بخوان. اطلاعات، لحن و کمبودها را اصلاح کن. به دو سؤالش جواب بده. بعد یادداشت تغییر بنویس."},"model":"Dear Lena,\nI'm sorry that your chairs are late. Your 40 grey chairs will now arrive on 17 March, because of a late shipment. That is three days before your opening. Delivery is free for late orders, so you pay nothing for it.\n\nChange note: The draft says black, but the sheet says grey. The draft says 19 March, but the sheet says 17 March. I can't find the discount, so I removed it, and I will ask my manager. I rewrote it in plain English and answered her two questions. I used AI to draft it, then I checked it against the order.","frame":"Dear ___,\nI'm sorry that ___. Your ___ will now arrive on ___, because ___. Delivery is ___.\n\nChange note: The draft says ___, but the sheet says ___. I can't find ___, so I removed it.","words":[{"word":"but the sheet says"},{"word":"I used AI to"}],"minWords":70,"minSentences":2,"rubric":["Task done: every point of the task is there","Organised: clear parts, in a sensible order","Language: the phrases of this lesson, used correctly","Tone: clear and honest; nothing you cannot explain"],"rubricI18n":{"tr":["Görev: görevin her noktası var","Düzen: açık bölümler, mantıklı sıra","Dil: bu dersin ifadeleri, doğru kullanılmış","Üslup: açık ve dürüst; açıklayamayacağın bir şey yok"],"fa":["کامل بودن کار: همه‌ی نکته‌های تمرین آمده","نظم: بخش‌های روشن، با ترتیب منطقی","زبان: عبارت‌های این درس، درست به کار رفته","لحن: روشن و صادق؛ چیزی که نتوانی توضیح بدهی در آن نیست"]},"b2Task":{"en":"B2 track: no frame. Use whereas once, and say what remains open for the manager.","tr":"B2 yolu: hazır çerçeve yok. Bir kez whereas kullan ve yöneticiye açık kalanı söyle.","fa":"مسیر B2: چارچوب آماده نداری. یک بار whereas بیاور و بگو مدیر چه چیزی را باید روشن کند."},"routes":[{"t":{"en":"I use an AI tool","tr":"Bir yapay zekâ aracı kullanıyorum","fa":"از یک ابزار هوش مصنوعی استفاده می‌کنم"},"s":{"en":"You may also give the same facts to your tool, then check its draft in the same way.","tr":"Aynı bilgileri aracına da verip taslağını aynı şekilde kontrol edebilirsin.","fa":"می‌توانی همین اطلاعات را به ابزارت هم بدهی و پیش‌نویسش را همین‌طور بررسی کنی."}},{"t":{"en":"I don't have a tool","tr":"Bir aracım yok","fa":"ابزاری ندارم"},"s":{"en":"Use the example draft above. The check is the same.","tr":"Yukarıdaki örnek taslağı kullan. Kontrol aynı.","fa":"از پیش‌نویس نمونه‌ی بالا استفاده کن. روش بررسی فرقی نمی‌کند."},"noTool":true}],"parts":[{"t":{"en":"The right facts: colour and date","tr":"Doğru bilgiler: renk ve tarih","fa":"واقعیت‌های درست: رنگ و تاریخ"},"find":["grey","17 march"],"sample":"40 grey chairs · now 17 March"},{"t":{"en":"Her two questions answered: when, and who pays","tr":"İki sorusunun yanıtı: ne zaman ve kim ödüyor","fa":"جواب دو سؤالش: کِی و چه کسی پول می‌دهد"},"find":["will now arrive","delivery is free","you pay nothing"],"sample":"arrive on 17 March · delivery is free, you pay nothing"},{"t":{"en":"Change note, with but the sheet says","tr":"Değişiklik notu, but the sheet says ile","fa":"یادداشت تغییر، با ⁨but the sheet says⁩"},"find":["but the sheet says","the draft says"],"sample":"the draft says black, but the sheet says grey"},{"t":{"en":"An honest note on how you used AI","tr":"Yapay zekâyı nasıl kullandığına dair dürüst bir not","fa":"یادداشتی صادقانه درباره‌ی اینکه چطور از هوش مصنوعی استفاده کردی"},"find":["i used ai to","i checked it"],"sample":"I used AI to draft it, then I checked it against the order"}]},"speaking":{"id":"ai-cp-3-s","course":"ai-internet","unit":"ai-cp-3","topic":{"en":"Explain your changes","tr":"Değişikliklerini açıkla","fa":"تغییرهایت را توضیح بده"},"warmup":{"en":"What would you want to hear if you were opening a cafe in six days?","tr":"Altı gün sonra kafe açacak olsan ne duymak isterdin?","fa":"اگر شش روز دیگر کافه باز می‌کردی، دوست داشتی چه بشنوی؟"},"questions":[{"en":"Explain your changes aloud to your manager, and say what you need from them.","tr":"Yöneticine değişikliklerini yüksek sesle açıkla ve ondan ne istediğini söyle.","fa":"تغییرهایت را بلند برای مدیرت توضیح بده و بگو از او چه می‌خواهی."},{"en":"The customer calls. Tell her the new date and who pays for delivery, in plain English.","tr":"Müşteri arıyor. Ona yeni tarihi ve teslimatı kimin ödeyeceğini sade İngilizceyle söyle.","fa":"مشتری تماس می‌گیرد. تاریخ جدید و اینکه هزینه‌ی ارسال با کیست را به انگلیسی ساده به او بگو."}],"followups":[{"en":"Now say it again about your own work. Use made-up names and numbers.","tr":"Şimdi aynısını kendi işin için söyle. Uydurma ad ve sayılar kullan.","fa":"حالا همین را درباره‌ی کار خودت بگو. از نام‌ها و عددهای ساختگی استفاده کن."}],"expressions":[{"phrase":"The draft says..., but...","meaning":{"en":"Shows a correction.","tr":"Bir düzeltmeyi gösterir.","fa":"یک اصلاح را نشان می‌دهد."}},{"phrase":"Could you approve...?","meaning":{"en":"Asks for a decision.","tr":"Karar ister.","fa":"تصمیم می‌خواهد."}}],"model":"I checked the AI draft against the order. The draft says black chairs and the nineteenth, but the sheet says grey and the seventeenth, so I corrected both. The document says that delivery is free for late orders. The draft also offered a discount. It isn't in the document, so I removed it. Could you approve anything extra for this customer? Her opening is very soon.","selfCheck":[{"en":"I did every point of the task.","tr":"Görevin her noktasını yaptım.","fa":"همه‌ی نکته‌های تمرین را انجام دادم."},{"en":"I used at least two phrases from this lesson.","tr":"Bu dersten en az iki ifade kullandım.","fa":"دست‌کم دو عبارت از این درس به کار بردم."},{"en":"I spoke in short, clear sentences.","tr":"Kısa ve net cümlelerle konuştum.","fa":"با جمله‌های کوتاه و روشن حرف زدم."},{"en":"I asked for one clear decision.","tr":"Net bir karar istedim.","fa":"یک تصمیم روشن خواستم."}]},"storySample":{"title":{"en":"Story sample: the late chairs","tr":"Hikâye örneği: geciken sandalyeler","fa":"نمونه‌ی داستانی: صندلی‌هایی که دیر رسید"},"note":{"en":"This short story is only the material for this chapter review. It does not continue anywhere.","tr":"Bu kısa hikâye yalnızca bu bölüm tekrarının malzemesidir. Başka yerde devam etmez.","fa":"این داستان کوتاه فقط متن کار همین مرور فصل است و جای دیگری ادامه ندارد."},"text":"Lena runs a small cafe in Vienna. She ordered 40 grey chairs for her new room, and the opening is on 20 March. On 14 March the chairs have not come. She writes: \"My opening is in six days. You promised 12 March. I have told my guests. Please tell me today when they will arrive, and who pays for the delay.\"","source":"Order 2210. 40 chairs, grey. Promised delivery 12 March. New delivery 17 March, because of a late shipment. Delay policy: delivery is free for late orders. No other compensation without a manager's approval.","draft":"Dear Valued Customer, We regret to inform you that your order of 40 black chairs has been delayed. It shall arrive at your earliest convenience, on 19 March. We apologise for any inconvenience and will give you a 20% discount on your next order. Kindly advise should you require further assistance.","id":"c-ai-cp-3-ss"}}; })(globalThis.COURSE_FILES = globalThis.COURSE_FILES || {});
